SUMMARY:YOGA IN NATURE™ at Apex Nature Park
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nJoin us for a 60 minute slow vinyasa f
 low to yin yoga practice\, designed for beginners (to intermediate) AND th
 ose new to yoga WELCOME.\nThe yoga practice (breath and asana) is infused 
 with a connection to nature in order to help calm the mind and energize th
 e body. Shade and sun options for your practice.\nYoga heals.\nNature heal
 s.\nCost is $15/person payable by cash\nOR Venmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 i
 f asked)\nOR PayPal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nAlso accepting payment wit
 h Zelle\nBring your yoga mat\, water\, towel or plastic liner for under yo
 ur mat (if you want to protect it from ground/wet) or anything else you ma
 y use for your yoga practice.\nYou may also want to bring sunscreen and in
 sect repellent.\nHope to see you soon!
