SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, SUP Yoga\, Falls Lake
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n***JOIN US FOR SUP YOGA (stand-up padd
 le board yoga) .*** **Payment is due at time of sign-up**\, in order to ho
 ld your spot. At least 4 attendees to run this class. **$40/person** inclu
 des basic paddle instruction\, yoga class on SUP\, anchors (to borrow for 
 class)\, and summertime snacks. *YOU WILL BE REIMBURSED IF IT RAINS and/or
  if I need to cancel.* *If you sign up and can’t make it\, you will rece
 ive a one time credit for a future SUP Yoga class to use this season.*\nCe
 rtified SUP yoga instructor to lead you in yoga\, on the water:)\nGrab you
 r Standup Paddle Board and meet us at Falls Lake.\nI have one board for re
 nt\, first come first serve ($25).I have also researched place(s) where yo
 u are able to rent a SUP board. You would be responsible for picking up an
 d then returning the board to the location. Recommendation to rent for 3-4
  hours\, as you will need time to pick it up\, use for the 1.5 hour class 
 then return it. I will have anchors to borrow\, upon request.\nRentals at 
 https://wakerack.com/\n\nWe will meet at the beach area and begin with bas
 ic instruction of the paddle strokes\, board\, etc. If you have already do
 ne SUP\, you can get out on the water\, and we will meet you there after 1
 5 minutes of intro. We will paddle out to one of the coves (15 - 20 minute
 s) then anchor down for about a 60 minute SUP yoga class. Then\, we will p
 addle back in unless you choose to remain on the water to explore. IF YOU 
 HAVE A NEW BOARD THIS SEASON\, PLEASE TAKE TIME TO INFLATE IT AT HOME TO M
 AKE SURE THERE ARE NO SLOW LEAKS (PRIOR TO GETTING ON THE WATER). FAMILIAR
 IZE YOURSELF WITH YOUR EQUIPMENT AT THE START OF THE SEASON AND BE READY T
 O INFLATE YOUR OWN BOARD WITH YOUR PUMP. THE GROUP THANKS YOU IN ADVANCE:)
 \n\nNOTE: There is an entrance fee for this location at Falls Lake. I beli
 eve it is $10 per car. Feel free to verify.\n\nPlease bring your board\; p
 addle\; anchor (OR I have anchors to lend out)\; water bottle\; sunscreen\
 , etc\; ***Good Pops will be provided\, but feel free to bring your own sn
 ack to enjoy before or after class:)***\n\nALL Levels welcome. $40 pay in 
 advance by Venmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 last 4 digits of phone if asked) 
 or PayPal at dgenander@yogainnature.com to hold your spot.\nAlso accepting
  Zelle.
